  vendorName: Architect Balthazar
  offerText: My scans indicate your ceiling joists are critically unstable. Pay my
    emergency engineering fee immediately, and we will install steel supports before
    it is too late.
  acceptResultText: You pay the exorbitant fee. The ugly steel pillars ruin your
    room's aesthetic, but you feel safe.
  rejectResultText: You laugh at his obvious scam and kick him out. Your money stays
    in your pocket, and you feel incredibly smart.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Balthazar wasn't lying! The ceiling catastrophically collapses
    on top of you! You are severely injured, buried in rubble, and forced to pay
    massive emergency medical bills.
